close_reason: "approval is trimmed where parent is trimmed, and a blank approval is refused as empty_approval rather than normalized to null. The normalization lives only at the parse boundary: a generation body can be hand-authored and never passes through a command flag, and stringOption already trims every option value, so no flag-side trim exists."
